
* How to create branch, merge branches, stash & git reset?

{Branch}

Commands-

- git branch                                   (To see list of available branches)
- git branch <New branch name>                 (Create a new branch)
- git checkout <name of branch you want to go> (To switch branch)
- git branch -d                                (Delete a branch)
- git branch -D                                (Delete a branch)

# The "-d" option will delete the branch only, If it has already pushed or merged with remote branch.
# Use "-D" if you want t force to deleted, If it has not pushed or merged yet.

